@page "/"
@layout MainLayout
@using System.Diagnostics

<PageTitle>BbScanner - barcode scanning for Blazor, decoded in C#</PageTitle>

@* The landing page: hero → proof strip → feature grid → code walkthrough → comparison with a
   JavaScript scanner → persona tiles → FAQ → final call to action. Everything else on the site is
   a documentation page under DocsLayout. The hero's sample decodes a real symbol in the visitor's
   own tab rather than showing a picture of a result - without opening a camera, so the first page
   of the site never asks for a permission. *@

