                QR Code, Micro QR, Data Matrix, PDF417, Aztec, MaxiCode, Code 128, Code 39, Code 93, Codabar,
                EAN-13, EAN-8, UPC-A, UPC-E, ITF and the GS1 DataBar family - from the camera or from still images. No barcode SDK and no JavaScript scanner library: the browser opens the
